      "text": "CellRank 的 lineage fate probability 与基因表达的相关性只能说明这些基因与命运概率存在统计关联，不能证明它们是驱动该谱系的因果基因。",
      "basis": "MODEL_KNOWLEDGE",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "在没有独立干预（independent_intervention=none）的情况下，无法区分相关性与因果性，因此“candidate driver genes”中的“driver”应被理解为候选而非已验证的驱动因素。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": ["user:independent_intervention"]
    },
    {
      "text": "可接受的措辞应明确限定为“lineage-correlated candidate driver genes”，并避免暗示已建立因果关系，例如：“These genes are lineage-correlated candidates that may play a role in driving the lineage, but causal validation is lacking.”",
